<title>MACEDONIA: SOCCER-MACEDONIA 3 IRELAND 2 WORLD CUP QUALIFIER - RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MACEDONIA 3 IRELAND 2 WORLD CUP QUALIFIER - RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>SKOPJE 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Macedonia beat Ireland 3-2</p>
<p>(halftime 2-1) in their World Cup European group eight qualifier</p>
<p>on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Macedonia - Mitko Stojkovski 29 pen, 44 pen, Goce Hristov 60</p>
<p>Ireland - Alan McLoughlin 8, David Kelly 78</p>
